   "text": "There are misc scratches around the vehicle. Normal for mileage and most too small to see in photos. There 3 dings on the passenger side doors. The paint shows some wear and tear that is consistent with age and mileage. The tires have a low tread depth measuring 7/32. It may require replacement soon."
