  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "There is light wear to the seats. Normal for mileage. The inner door panels, interior trim, and carpet show wear consistent with age and mileage. The windows, locks, and mirrors were all functional, and the gauges were in working order. There were no signs of smoke or unusual odors."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "The vehicle's mechanical components were inspected, and no signs of leaks or seepages were observed underneath. Upon examining under the hood, it was noted that the accessible fluids were at their correct levels and in good condition."
